  "body_html": "<h1>Matrix Game</h1>\n<p>A finite zero-sum game is represented by a matrix $A=(A_{ij})_{i \\in I,j \\in J}$.\nThe maximizing player chooses a row $i \\in I$, the minimizing player chooses a\ncolumn $j \\in J$, and $A_{ij}$ is the payoff of the maximizing player.  Conversely,\nany real matrix determines a finite zero-sum game in this way.</p>",
